# Respect author hand style

The owner programs **by hand**. Existing code in a file is their voice.

## Do

- Change only what they asked
- Keep their `const` / `local`, names, stubs, section markers, and WIP
- Mirror their patterns when adding lines in the same file

## Do not

- Rewrite or "clean up" organization without an explicit ask
- Swap `const` ↔ `local` (or helper declaration style) unprompted
- Fill/delete incomplete functions they are writing unless requested

Author hand style in the open file wins over agent preference for cleaner structure.
